translate schinese hscene47_Erik_Lyna_Helga_f5a5d29d:
    e "别担心妈，我扶着你。你不会摔倒的。"

translate schinese hscene47_Erik_Lyna_Helga_f8a62ccd:
    h "那不、不是问题……"

translate schinese hscene47_Erik_Lyna_Helga_6d38cab7:
    l "埃里克，又轮到你了。"

translate schinese hscene47_Erik_Lyna_Helga_8e6875a8:
    e "什么？！这——你这一整轮根本没动过！"

translate schinese hscene47_Erik_Lyna_Helga_7286e910:
    l "我的游戏，我的规则！"

translate schinese hscene47_Erik_Lyna_Helga_b6247833:
    l "现在，右手黄色。快点。"

translate schinese hscene47_Erik_Lyna_Helga_6ee1f251:
    e "莱娜求你了……"

translate schinese hscene47_Erik_Lyna_Helga_b1196b4f:
    h "就、就照做吧宝贝。"

translate schinese hscene47_Erik_Lyna_Helga_ed102b6f:
    em "我的老天啊。"

translate schinese hscene47_Erik_Lyna_Helga_5c68c33e:
    l "我明白了。看来得我再问一遍。"

